// Lightning flashes for thunderstuff (sv_river_outpost.coop.script). Placeholder origins --
// reposition these in the editor so each one is up in open sky/visible from the play area,
// same idea as radar's lightning01-05. STARTOFF|ONETIME (spawnflags 6): invisible until
// alertentity fires it, then it flashes through the stylestring once and goes dark again.
